# astrion-skill v1
goal: Show the 5 most recently used files
trigger:
  - phrase: "recent files"
  - phrase: "recently opened"
  - phrase: "what did I just open"
do: |
  Read the 'nova-recent-files' localStorage record (a rolling array
  of {appId, filePath, openedAt} written by every app on file open;
  capped at 50). Show the most recent 5 as Spotlight result rows
  with file name, app icon, and "X minutes ago" timestamp. Clicking
  a row dispatches a file:open event with the path so the owning
  app reopens it.
constraints:
  level: L1
  budget_tokens: 150
  reversibility: FREE
